title Target-only Executable Builtin Definition
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@0bb794f2 modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/command/CommandDefinition.java.
' Design reason: each contributor owns metadata, admission, and handler; no central command-name switch.
' Source evidence: pi-mono-java@6f52fddc modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/runtimeapi/session/RuntimeSessionResponseAssembler.java getView.
' Architecture change: project business resources, never serialize the internal command receipt.
interface BuiltinCommandContributor
class BuiltinCommandSource <<singleton>>
class BuiltinCommandDefinition <<immutable>>
interface CommandHandler
interface CommandAdmissionPolicy
class CommandExecutionContext <<request>>
class CommandExecutionService <<singleton>>
class CommandResponseAssembler <<singleton>>
class CommandResultDTO
class RuntimeSessionResponseAssembler <<existing singleton>>
class GetSessionResponseVO <<existing immutable>>
class AvailableModelsResponseVO <<existing immutable>>
class "AgentHelp / Compaction / BoundSkills\nResponseVOs" as BusinessVOs <<target-only immutable>>
interface NarrowDomainService
BuiltinCommandSource o-- "7" BuiltinCommandContributor
BuiltinCommandContributor --> BuiltinCommandDefinition
BuiltinCommandSource *-- "7" BuiltinCommandDefinition
BuiltinCommandDefinition *-- CommandHandler
BuiltinCommandDefinition *-- CommandAdmissionPolicy
CommandExecutionService --> CommandExecutionContext
CommandExecutionService --> BuiltinCommandDefinition
CommandHandler --> NarrowDomainService
CommandHandler ..> CommandResultDTO
CommandExecutionService --> CommandResponseAssembler
CommandResponseAssembler ..> CommandResultDTO
CommandResponseAssembler --> RuntimeSessionResponseAssembler
RuntimeSessionResponseAssembler ..> GetSessionResponseVO
CommandResponseAssembler ..> AvailableModelsResponseVO
CommandResponseAssembler ..> BusinessVOs
note bottom of CommandResponseAssembler
Only result-type dispatch lives here.
Controllers never expose internal DTOs.
No public command, changed or sourceEventSeq.
end note
CommandExecutionService -[hidden]down-> BuiltinCommandDefinition
BuiltinCommandDefinition -[hidden]down-> CommandHandler
CommandHandler -[hidden]down-> NarrowDomainService
CommandResponseAssembler -[hidden]down-> RuntimeSessionResponseAssembler
AvailableModelsResponseVO -[hidden]down-> BusinessVOs
BuiltinCommandSource -[hidden]down-> BuiltinCommandContributor
CommandExecutionContext -[hidden]down-> CommandExecutionService
@enduml

